jobs.description:
Responsibilities

Responsible for the energy storage project development in the United States, actively expanding overseas markets;
Conduct research on market product planning requirements, share the information with relevant support departments, develop solutions, and assist in designing products suitable for the market;
Develop global partnerships and establish a robust upstream and downstream business ecosystem in BESS industry, including developing partnerships with local developers, consultants, grid companies and financial facilities.
Building the company's brand and competitiveness;

Qualifications

Bachelor's degree or above, with a major in battery, engineering, or electrical power preferred;
Priority will be given to candidates with over 2-3 years of experience in market development for photovoltaic inverters, photovoltaic modules, and energy storage;
Candidates familiar with American cultures and with overseas study, living, or work experience will be preferred;
Fluent in English.

